===Etymology===
[[Категорија:Енглески појмови изведени из Proto-Indo-European|WOMAN]][[Категорија:Енглески појмови изведени из Proto-Indo-European корена *mon-|WOMAN]]
From <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Модул:etymology/templates/inherited: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q36395 site=enwiki</span></strong>, from earlier <i class="Latn mention" lang="enm">[[wifman#Средњи Енглески|wifman]]</i>. The Middle English forms are from <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Модул:etymology/templates/inherited: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q42365 site=enwiki</span></strong>, a compound of <i class="Latn mention" lang="ang">[[wif#Стари Енглески|wīf]]</i> <span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">(</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">“</span><span class="mention-gloss">woman</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">”</span>, <span class="ann-pos">whence <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Модул:etymology/templates/cognate: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q1860 site=enwiki</span></strong>[[Категорија:links likely containing transcriptions in pos]]</span><span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">)</span> +&lrm; <i class="Latn mention" lang="ang">[[mann#Стари Енглески|mann]]</i> <span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">(</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">“</span><span class="mention-gloss">person</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">”</span>, <span class="ann-pos">whence <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Модул:etymology/templates/cognate: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q1860 site=enwiki</span></strong>[[Категорија:links likely containing transcriptions in pos]]</span><span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">)</span>. For details on the pronunciation and spelling history, see the usage notes below.

Cognate with <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Модул:etymology/templates/cognate: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q14549 site=enwiki</span></strong>, <i class="Latn mention" lang="sco">[[weman#Шкотски|weman]]</i>. Compare <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Модул:etymology/templates/cognate: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q27154 site=enwiki</span></strong>. Similar constructions can be found in <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Модул:etymology/templates/cognate: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q27175 site=enwiki</span></strong> (from <i class="Latn mention" lang="fy">[[frou#West Frisian|frou]]</i> and <i class="Latn mention" lang="fy">[[minske#West Frisian|minske]]</i>, literally "woman human").

A few alternative spellings (see below) respell the term so as not to contain ''man''.

